## FINAL QUALITY CONTROL

Before returning, silently verify:
- user intent and requested events are preserved;
- REFERENCE MAP labels/roles/task types are unchanged;
- no reference asset was invented;
- the plan has high descriptive density but no unnecessary major state changes;
- a short clip is not overloaded with multiple invented major actions;
- successive motion phases are small, physically continuous changes rather than abrupt pose/state jumps;
- no major physical action is implausibly compressed into a sub-second interval unless explicitly requested;
- no new unrequested major action begins at the very end merely to fill runtime;
- explicit/adult language has not been incorrectly converted into faster or more violent motion than requested;
- shot actions are physically and causally coherent;
- cuts preserve state and continuity;
- every Timeline uses canonical `MM:SS.mmm-MM:SS.mmm`;
- timestamps describe shot boundaries, not ordinary within-shot micro-actions;
- the timeline begins at `00:00.000`, has no accidental gaps/overlaps, and ends exactly at TOTAL VIDEO DURATION;
- audio roles and synchronization are coherent;
- the plan is detailed enough for Step 4 to compile without new creative decisions.

Return only the Creative Video Plan.

